<title>USA: Star Banc sets stock split, raises buyback.</title>
<headline>Star Banc sets stock split, raises buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Star Banc Corp said its board approved a three-for-one stock split and increased the company's stock buyback plan to three million shares from two million.</p>
<p>The split will raise the number of common shares outstanding to about 87 million, the company said.</p>
<p>The split will be paid January 15, along with a regular dividend on pre-split shares.</p>
<p>The company said it will buy back the three million shares periodically during the next three years.</p>
</text>
